{
  "slug": "excalidrawer",
  "name": "Excalidrawer",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Code-first Excalidraw diagram generation with SVG and PNG export. Say \"draw a flowchart\" or \"create an architecture diagram\" and it just works — no browser required. Supports flowcharts, architecture diagrams, sequence diagrams, and timelines from JSON data. Uses resvg-js for fast native PNG rendering.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **5 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (5): `architecture` (Generate a hand-drawn-style Excalidraw architecture diagram from code and export to .excalidraw / SVG / PNG — no…), `flowchart` (Generate a hand-drawn-style Excalidraw flowchart from code and export to .excalidraw / SVG / PNG — no browser), `sequence` (Generate a hand-drawn-style Excalidraw sequence diagram from code and export to .excalidraw / SVG / PNG — no…), `shared` (Shared base for the excalidrawer diagram skills (flowchart / timeline / architecture / sequence)), `timeline` (Generate a hand-drawn-style Excalidraw timeline from code and export to .excalidraw / SVG / PNG — no browser)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `excalidrawer`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install excalidrawer@claude-community` from `guohaonan-shy/excalidrawer`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 5,
    "mcp": 1
  },
